{"c":"443056","n":"ÚŠTĚCKÝ POTOK 1","t":"P","s":"SČ","o":"Litoměřice","url":"443056-ustecky-potok-1","stav":"2026-10-07","popis":"Přítok Labe. Od vtoku do Labe v k. ú. Nučnice až k pramenům. K revíru patří:\n\n**0. Úštěcký potok (hlavní tok)**\n\n**1. Habřina**\n(GPS Z: 50°34'50.363\"N, 14°20'37.675\"E, K: 50°34'49.796\"N, 14°19'32.445\"E)\n\nLov ryb je zakázán na chovných úsecích:\n- pramenná část Úštěckého potoka od železničního mostu tratě Litoměřice – Česká Lípa pod osadou Líčnice,\n- pramenná část potoka Habřina od silničního mostu Úštěk–Litoměřice a všechny ostatní přítoky.\n\n**Zákaz lovu ryb přívlačí v období od 1. 9. do 30. 11.**","delka":30,"rozloha":7,"lat":50.554089,"lon":14.2984,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/litomerice","mo_tel":"+420 416 735 047","mo_mail":"crs.ltm@seznam.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-10-31","h":"07:00–19:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podhorní","min":30,"m